arStrings.szText:
{icon:BossPower_B_Icon, 2}{if:SF_19}{c_gray}{/if} {c_label}Main{/c}
Hitting an enemy affected by Damage over Time spawns a wave of acid that deals {c_random}{dot:DOT_TOOLTIP}{/c} Poisoning damage over {c_number}{SF_3}{/c} seconds. Applies {c_number}[{SF_15}*100|%|]{/c} more Poisoning for each {c_number}[1|%|]{/c} of the target's current Life affected by Damage over Time.{if:SF_19}{/c}{/if} 

{icon:BossPower_A_Icon, 2}{if:SF_18}{c_gray}{/if} {c_label}Modifier{/c}
Once per activation, damaging an enemy with your {c_important}Main{/c} Boss Power also applies {c_random}{dot:DOT_SUBVERSIVE_TOOLTIP}{/c} Poisoning damage to it over {c_number}{SF_10}{/c} seconds.{if:SF_18}{/c}{/if}
